# Pre-rebrand paths. Nothing in the tree writes these any more, but the voice
# debug log holds transcribed conversation, and the rename left the OLD paths
# unguarded — a long-running pre-rename server or an older checkout will still
# fill them, and an unignored directory of conversation logs is one `git add -A`
# away from being published. Observed for real on 2026-09-11: a preview server
# started before the rename kept writing .gev-logs/ while the source said
# .mashaer-logs/, and the directory showed up untracked.
.gev-logs/
.gev-cache/
.godsEyeView-logs/
.DS_Store
.gstack/
3d-models/
pinokio/ENVIRONMENT
pinokio/.installed
